  "body": "Sun-filled, private, and beautifully positioned, this spacious residence offers an exceptional opportunity to enjoy relaxed, low-maintenance living in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for comfort and everyday ease, the home combines generous proportions, natural light, and welcoming interiors with a wonderful sense of privacy. Equally suited to relaxed family living and effortless entertaining, it offers a lifestyle where convenience and tranquillity come together.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, spacious open-plan living and dining areas flow seamlessly to a private, sun-drenched outdoor setting, framed by established, easy-care gardens. An inviting space to entertain friends, enjoy long summer afternoons or simply unwind.\r\n\r\nThe well-appointed kitchen offers quality appliances, generous bench space and ample storage, bringing practicality and functionality to everyday living.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is thoughtfully arranged across two levels, with three generously proportioned bedrooms, each featuring custom-fitted wardrobes. The particularly spacious master suite enjoys the added comfort of its own ensuite.\r\n\r\nTwo modern bathrooms, a separate powder room, excellent storage throughout and a double internal-access garage further enhance the home's everyday appeal.\r\n\r\nBeautifully comfortable as it stands, the property also presents an opportunity for those wishing to introduce their own touches and add value over time.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location. Just a short stroll from St Heliers village, the beach, parks, cafés and local amenities, everything that makes this sought-after coastal community so special is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nA wonderful combination of space, privacy, and easy-care living in a tightly held St Heliers location. Move in, make it your own, and enjoy the Bay-side lifestyle!",
